WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.820
Section eighteen.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.810
The complete trace and next steps.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.080
The purpose is to reconnect the technical layers to

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:10.940
the original need:

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.980
find useful repositories,

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.420
understand why they belong together, and keep control as

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:18.480
the collection changes.

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:31.390
Orion's source sentence explains patient intake, the clinical

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:31.870
initiative,

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.170
FastAPI, and Python.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.370
Local extraction retains evidence one.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:39.650
Retrieval finds six possibilities.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.270
Augmentation supplies evidence,

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:43.310
definitions,

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.730
policy, and schema.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:48.150
Generation returns four supported IDs.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:52.210
Validation and review establish usable relationships.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:56.050
A receipt preserves completed work even if the user

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:57.370
later removes a Project.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:07.810
Readiness phases, frozen corpora, source hashes, lockfiles,

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:11.090
reports, and historical ledgers preserve what was actually tested.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.930
Reconstructing a request offline is not recovering an original

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:16.510
wire log.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:21.010
This animation does not rerun application or model benchmarks.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.350
The original academic,

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:27.230
illustrated, and publication editions remain available with exact

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:27.630
inputs,

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:28.710
formulas,

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:30.850
qualifications, and references.

00:01:36.883 --> 00:01:39.083
The next steps are better evidence packing,

00:01:39.803 --> 00:01:40.843
tighter validation parity,

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:45.503
independent evaluation, and only then conditional retrieval or

00:01:45.503 --> 00:01:46.863
decision-model experiments.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:51.510
Cloud migration needs separate concurrency and recovery

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:52.130
validation.

00:01:53.577 --> 00:01:55.337
The practical habit is simple:

00:01:55.997 --> 00:02:00.317
put the source, shortlist, request, answer, and resulting state

00:02:00.317 --> 00:02:01.257
beside one another.

00:02:02.964 --> 00:02:03.924
Change one user decision,

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.004
follow the next run, and measure what improved.
